equired for this declared-entry conclusion. Store-call success or failure and concurrent state changes are outside the authorization conclusion. Source discovery is not-tested, so this result does not claim repository-wide or deployment completeness.","facts":[{"id":"fact-entry-create-share","kind":"entry","statement":"CreateMemoShare begins by fetching the current user, rejecting an unauthenticated caller, resolving the memo from request.Parent, and checking that the memo is active.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":23,"endLine":49}]},{"id":"fact-principal-identity-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler uses the fetched current user as the actor for authorization and for the share creation policy.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":26,"endLine":33},{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":66,"endLine":75}]},{"id":"fact-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The requested memo name is resolved to a memo, and the selected memo must exist and have active row status before authorization proceeds.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":37,"endLine":49}]},{"id":"fact-author-or-admin-control","kind":"control","statement":"CanManageMemo permits an active memo author or an active instance administrator; the administrator test requires an active user with the ADMIN role.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":55,"endLine":75},{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":83,"endLine":85}]},{"id":"fact-space-audience-control","kind":"control","statement":"After the author-or-admin check, the handler rejects a memo whose audience is SPACE.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":51,"endLine":56}]},{"id":"fact-expiry-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"If an expiry is supplied, the handler requires it to be later than the current time; the task premise supplies a valid expiry when present.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":57,"endLine":64}]},{"id":"fact-protected-create-share-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"After the authorization checks, the handler constructs a share with the selected memo ID and a policy marked CreatingShare, then invokes Store.CreateMemoShare.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":66,"endLine":80}]},{"id":"fact-store-policy-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"The store validates the supplied memo-write policy and delegates the share creation operation; whether that external store operation succeeds is not part of the authorization conclusion.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-94b067169ac3605d","startLine":37,"endLine":48}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":14749,"output":1047,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":36659.909199999995,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-28T18:03:03.353Z"}}
